cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "CCIP-BR-04: calibrating RJFMP coral cover and Crown-of-Thorns Starfish monitoring methods"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gladish
    given-names: Dan
    email: dan.gladish@csiro.au
    affiliation: "CSIRO"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for CCIP-BR-04. Bayesian mixed models calibrate coral cover and
  Crown-of-Thorns Starfish (COTS) measurements from manta tow, ReefScan Surface,
  ReefScan Deep and eDNA against one another at manta-tow, cull-site and reef
  scale, with uncertainty, using data from Reef Joint Field Management Program
  (RJFMP) voyages in 2025-26. RHIS is summarised descriptively. Includes an
  interactive calibration-curve explorer (Shiny).
keywords:
  - Great Barrier Reef
  - Crown-of-Thorns Starfish
  - coral cover
  - monitoring calibration
  - Bayesian mixed models
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/dangladish/ccip-br-04"
url: "https://github.com/dangladish/ccip-br-04"
